libnxml
------------------------------------------
nXML is a C library for parsing, writing and creating XML 1.0 and 1.1 files or
streams. It supports utf-8, utf-16be and utf-16le, ucs-4 (1234, 4321, 2143,
2312).

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libnxml-devel-0.18.6-1bl1
  libnxml0-0.18.6-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/bakulf/libnxml

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/bakulf/libnxml/archive/refs/tags/0.18.6.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libnxml-0.18.6-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libnxml-0.18.6-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libnxml-0.18.6-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnxml-0.18.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnxml0-0.18.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnxml-devel-0.18.6-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libnxml)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libnxml.README
  /usr/share/doc/libnxml/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libnxml/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libnxml/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libnxml/README

(libnxml0)
  /usr/bin/cygnxml-0.dll

(libnxml-devel)
  /usr/include/nxml.h
  /usr/lib/libnxml.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/nxml.pc

